 "remarks": "Welcome to 94 Washington Street, Unit 9, where modern style and effortless city living come together in the heart of Norwalk. Located in the Haviland Arms complex, this beautifully updated condo offers a bright, inviting interior with soaring 9 ft ceilings and an airy open layout designed for both everyday comfort and easy entertaining. Large windows fill the living space with natural light while offering city views and a front row seat to the energy of the neighborhood. The living area flows seamlessly into the updated kitchen, featuring crisp white cabinetry, sleek counters and a functional breakfast bar that creates the perfect spot for morning coffee, casual meals or conversation with friends. The spacious bedroom offers a comfortable retreat with plenty of room to relax, while the full bath is conveniently positioned for easy access. Elevator access and low maintenance condo living make coming home simple, but the location may be the true standout. Restaurants, shops, public transportation and the excitement of downtown Norwalk are all close by, putting everyday conveniences and local favorites within easy reach. Whether you're searching for a stylish primary residence or a smart investment opportunity, this move in ready condo delivers the perfect blend of comfort, convenience and urban lifestyle.",
